  "title": "🎟️ Maybe the Finale of My Museum Card",
  "date": "2026-02-20T22:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "🎟️ Maybe the Finale of My Museum Card\n\nMy museum card is officially expiring on 9th March 🗓️. To make sure I got every penny's worth, I went on a bit of a museum marathon! 🏃‍♂️💨\n\nHere is where I spent my time:\n\nTallinn Museum of Orders of Knighthood 🎖️\n\nThe Estonian Museum of Natural History 🦌\n\nEstonian Applied Art and Design Museum 🎨\n\nEstonian Health Museum 🧠\n\n⭐ Top Pick: Tallinn Museum of Orders of Knighthood\n\nTallinn Museum of Orders of Knighthood\n\nI strongly suggest visiting this one! It’s a specialized, intimate museum packed with stunning medals from all over the globe—even from Asia 🌏. I was surprised to find Manchukuo medals here!\n\nA few tips for your visit:\n\nHistory Fans: This is a total \"must-visit\" 🏛️.\n\nTech Buddy: Using AI while browsing helped me dive deep into the historical context of the pieces. 🤖📖\n\nTiming: The museum is small. If you just want to look at the medals, you’ll be done in a few minutes. But if you're a history buff, give yourself time to soak it all in! ✨",
